1. Abstract

SSS is an optimization mechanism of hidden Markov networks using the same 
expectation maximization criteria as the HMM learning.

2. Configuration

HMM Engine ............ HMM (Viterbi) learning 
Network Generator ..... New network by splitting the chosen state
Network Tester ........ Determine a state and splitting
GUI Monitor ........... Network shape and output/transition probabilities

3. Features

This system provides:
(1) a hidden Markov model for a set of amino acid sequences of proteins;
(2) an optimal network and hidden Markov model using the SSS algorithm;
(3) network optimization and HMM learning by the expectation maximization.

4. Environment

Machine     : UNIX Workstation(tested in Sparc10)
Environment : UNIX, X Window(Motif)
Language    : C
Source Code : 100 kbytes

