6. Usage

(1) Install

	-1- set SRC in Makefile
	-2- make		for installation
	-3- make HmnALC		for auto lenear configuration file makeup

(2) Clearances

	-4- make clean		for recompilation
	-5- make allclean	for all reinstallation

(3) Run

	-1- setenv XENVIRONMENT DHMM.res
	-2- ./DHMM
